===== power-up with a /fram/boot on the FRAM, FRAM_BOOT=0 =====

plan2040 on ?
  ls            list /dev and bin/
  help          builtins, grammar, often needed (reboot, bootsel, ...)
running built-in 'boot' automatically (this firmware ignores /fram/boot; `run /fram/boot` runs it by hand)...
% date
date: not found (try 'ls')
% toggle /dev/buttons/lamp /dev/lamp &
[1]
% cat /fram/boot
echo this is /fram/boot
% run /fram/boot
% echo this is /fram/boot
this is /fram/boot
% 
exit 0
